<title>UK: Japan's JFM to launch $400 mln 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Japan's JFM to launch $400 mln 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Finance Corp for Municipal Enterprises (JFM) will launch a $400 million 10-year Eurobond in the near future, Merrill Lynch International said on Monday as joint lead manager.</p>
<p>The deal will be guaranteed by Japan.</p>
<p>Tokyo-Mitsubishi International will be the other joint lead.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
